{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-59980","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-89437","text":"stackdocs — the whole [&] stack, as a filesystem you can walk"}]},{"id":"blk-59981","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89438","text":"A single, navigable documentation site that "},{"id":"spn-89439","marks":["bold"],"text":"mirrors the live repository's filesystem"},{"id":"spn-89440","text":": every real "},{"id":"spn-89441","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-89442","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-89443","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-89444","text":" markdown file across all 43 projects — plus each project's own root-level markdown, where TRVM, TRAAVIIS and WRL keep nearly all of theirs — becomes a page whose route "},{"id":"spn-89445","marks":["italic"],"text":"is"},{"id":"spn-89446","text":" its source path. No files are moved. Open "},{"id":"spn-89447","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/index.html"},{"id":"spn-89448","text":" — single file, no server."}]},{"id":"blk-59982","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-89449","text":"What it is"}]},{"id":"blk-59983","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89450","text":"The home page is a "},{"id":"spn-89451","marks":["bold"],"text":"Runefort campus"},{"id":"spn-89452","text":": the stack rendered as a place you can walk. Directories are floors (campus → building → floor), documents are rooms. The left rail is the real filesystem tree; the top bar is a live breadcrumb of the current path. Each document page shows its "},{"id":"spn-89453","marks":["bold"],"text":"source path"},{"id":"spn-89454","text":" (with a copy button), the rendered markdown, and a right rail of typed neighbors: outgoing links, "},{"id":"spn-89455","marks":["bold"],"text":"backlinks"},{"id":"spn-89456","text":" (\"referenced by\"), and siblings in the same folder."}]},{"id":"blk-59984","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89457","text":"Because "},{"id":"spn-89458","marks":["code"],"text":"route === source path"},{"id":"spn-89459","text":", an AI agent reading the rendered docs can round- trip back to the exact file on disk, and vice-versa. "},{"id":"spn-89460","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-89461","text":" is the machine-readable route⇄source map for exactly this."}]},{"id":"blk-59985","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-89462","text":"How it dogfoods the stack (in the build, not as metaphor)"}]},{"id":"blk-59986","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89463","marks":["code"],"text":"build-atlas.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89464","text":" uses the real "},{"id":"spn-89465","marks":["code"],"text":"@bendscript/core"},{"id":"spn-89466","text":" npm package to:"}]},{"id":"blk-59987","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-59989","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89467","marks":["bold"],"text":"Mirror the filesystem"},{"id":"spn-89468","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-89469","marks":["code"],"text":"tree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89470","text":" scans the repo (excluding"}]}],"id":"blk-59988","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true},{"id":"blk-59990","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89471","marks":["code"],"text":"node_modules"},{"id":"spn-89472","text":", "},{"id":"spn-89473","marks":["code"],"text":"_build"},{"id":"spn-89474","text":", "},{"id":"spn-89475","marks":["code"],"text":"deps"},{"id":"spn-89476","text":", "},{"id":"spn-89477","marks":["code"],"text":"old_scrap"},{"id":"spn-89478","text":", and every dot-directory except "},{"id":"spn-89479","marks":["code"],"text":".claude"},{"id":"spn-89480","text":", so gitignored local state like "},{"id":"spn-89481","marks":["code"],"text":".amp/"},{"id":"spn-89482","text":" is never published), collecting every "},{"id":"spn-89483","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-89484","text":"+"},{"id":"spn-89485","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-89486","text":" "},{"id":"spn-89487","marks":["code"],"text":".md"},{"id":"spn-89488","text":" file, each project's root-level markdown, and the top-level stack docs. 350 docs / 43 projects."}]},{"id":"blk-59991","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-59993","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89489","marks":["bold"],"text":"Turn each file into a validated BendScript document"},{"id":"spn-89490","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-89491","marks":["code"],"text":"ingest.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89492","text":" parses"}]}],"id":"blk-59992","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":2},{"id":"blk-59994","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89493","text":"the markdown to blocks; "},{"id":"spn-89494","marks":["code"],"text":"render.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89495","text":" emits BendScript; each doc is validated against the protocol schema, normalized, and "},{"id":"spn-89496","marks":["bold"],"text":"content-addressed"},{"id":"spn-89497","text":" (CIDv1). The CID is shown in the reader rail — change a file, its id changes."}]},{"id":"blk-59995","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-59997","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89498","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type every cross-doc link as an edge"},{"id":"spn-89499","text":" — relative "},{"id":"spn-89500","marks":["code"],"text":".md"},{"id":"spn-89501","text":" links that resolve"}]}],"id":"blk-59996","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":3},{"id":"blk-59998","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89502","text":"to a known route become internal navigation; the graph is inverted to produce backlinks. Unresolvable links degrade gracefully (never fail the build)."}]},{"id":"blk-59999","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60001","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89503","marks":["bold"],"text":"Verify the round-trip invariant"},{"id":"spn-89504","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-89505","marks":["code"],"text":"parse(serialize(parse(d)))"},{"id":"spn-89506","text":" is checked"}]}],"id":"blk-60000","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":true,"start":4},{"id":"blk-60002","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89507","text":"to be a CID fixpoint across the whole corpus — the protocol's load-bearing claim, now proven over 223 real documents."}]},{"id":"blk-60003","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89508","text":"The campus "},{"id":"spn-89509","marks":["italic"],"text":"is"},{"id":"spn-89510","text":" Runefort's "},{"id":"spn-89511","marks":["code"],"text":"codebase-atlas"},{"id":"spn-89512","text":" idea; the pages "},{"id":"spn-89513","marks":["italic"],"text":"are"},{"id":"spn-89514","text":" BendScript's \"prose is one projection of the graph.\" The medium is the message."}]},{"id":"blk-60004","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-89515","text":"Robustness: the build never breaks on real content"}]},{"id":"blk-60005","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89516","text":"Real markdown is messy. The ingest pipeline falls back to a raw code-block view for any document it can't cleanly parse, counting fallbacks in the build report (currently "},{"id":"spn-89517","marks":["bold"],"text":"0"},{"id":"spn-89518","text":"). So new or unusual docs join the atlas automatically without ever failing the build."}]},{"id":"blk-60006","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-89519","text":"Build it"}]},{"id":"blk-60007","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"npm i                 # box-and-box + @bendscript/core\nnpm run build         # node build-atlas.mjs → dist/index.html + dist/atlas.json + dist/bend/*\nnpm run build:curated # the earlier 21-page curated proof (node build.mjs)"},{"id":"blk-60008","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89520","text":"Build report (actual output):"}]},{"id":"blk-60009","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"  ✓ 350 real docs mirrored from 43 projects (no files moved)\n  ✓ route === source path for every page (lossless agent round-trip)\n  ✓ 360 cross-doc links resolved to internal navigation\n  ✓ every page is a validated, content-addressed BendScript document\n  ✓ round-trip CID fixpoint holds across the corpus: true\n  ✓ 0 doc(s) fell back to raw view (unparseable markdown)"},{"id":"blk-60010","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-89521","text":"Extending it"}]},{"id":"blk-60011","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60013","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89522","marks":["bold"],"text":"Add docs:"},{"id":"spn-89523","text":" just add markdown under any project's "},{"id":"spn-89524","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/"},{"id":"spn-89525","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-89526","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/"},{"id":"spn-89527","text":". The"}]}],"id":"blk-60012","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-60014","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89528","text":"next build picks it up — it joins the tree, the floors, search, and the graph."}]},{"id":"blk-60015","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60017","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89529","marks":["bold"],"text":"Point an agent at it:"},{"id":"spn-89530","text":" read "},{"id":"spn-89531","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-89532","text":" for the "},{"id":"spn-89533","marks":["code"],"text":"route ⇄ source"}]}],"id":"blk-60016","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-60018","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89534","text":"mapping, or read any "},{"id":"spn-89535","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/bend/<slug>.bend.json"},{"id":"spn-89536","text":" for the content-addressed BendScript form of a single file."}]},{"id":"blk-60019","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-89537","text":"Files"}]},{"id":"blk-60020","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60022","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89538","marks":["code"],"text":"build-atlas.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89539","text":" — the filesystem-mirror build (primary)"}]}],"id":"blk-60021","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60024","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89540","marks":["code"],"text":"tree.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89541","text":" — repo scan → filesystem tree + route↔source map"}]}],"id":"blk-60023","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60026","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89542","marks":["code"],"text":"ingest.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89543","text":" — markdown → BendScript blocks (with raw-view fallback)"}]}],"id":"blk-60025","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60028","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89544","marks":["code"],"text":"render.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89545","text":" — BendScript → HTML, link resolution"}]}],"id":"blk-60027","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60030","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89546","marks":["code"],"text":"shell-atlas.css"},{"id":"spn-89547","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-89548","marks":["code"],"text":"shell-atlas.js"},{"id":"spn-89549","text":" — the Runefort campus client"}]}],"id":"blk-60029","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60032","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89550","marks":["code"],"text":"dist/"},{"id":"spn-89551","text":" — built site ("},{"id":"spn-89552","marks":["code"],"text":"index.html"},{"id":"spn-89553","text":", "},{"id":"spn-89554","marks":["code"],"text":"atlas.json"},{"id":"spn-89555","text":", "},{"id":"spn-89556","marks":["code"],"text":"bend/*.bend.json"},{"id":"spn-89557","text":")"}]}],"id":"blk-60031","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60034","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-89558","marks":["code"],"text":"build.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89559","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-89560","marks":["code"],"text":"content.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89561","text":" / "},{"id":"spn-89562","marks":["code"],"text":"sources.mjs"},{"id":"spn-89563","text":" — the earlier curated 21-page proof"}]}],"id":"blk-60033","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieravxamdzb7vb4gpbvq7h3vbcuhnq5b3crshejfe354urv3kug5pyhq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}